OL,3,GNEWSAVillage residents hoping to buy
OL,4,Atheir local pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a Lincolnshire village are
OL,7,Ftrying to raise money to buy and reopen
OL,8,Ftheir local pub.
OL,10,FThe Ship Inn at Surfleet Seas End, near
OL,11,FSpalding, closed more than a year ago
OL,12,Fand is on the market for #550,000.
OL,14,FIt has recently been listed as an Asset
OL,15,Fof Community Value, which gives local
OL,16,Fgroups a chance to delay the sale of
OL,17,Fthe property and place a community bid.
OL,19,FMark Newlands, from the community group
OL,20,FShipmates, said the pub was a centre of
OL,21,Factivity, "not just for eating and
OL,22,Fdrinking, it was a place to socialise".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
